@startuml ESP Device Management
title ESP Device Management

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "ESP Device" as ESP

== Viewing ESP Devices ==
User -> App: Open devices screen
App -> API: GET /api/esp-devices/
API -> DB: Fetch user's ESP devices
DB -> API: Return device list
API -> App: ESP device data
App -> User: Display ESP device list

== Assigning ESP to Garden ==
User -> App: Select "Assign to Garden"
App -> User: Show garden selection
User -> App: Choose garden
App -> API: POST /api/esp-devices/{esp_id}/assign
API -> DB: Update ESP with garden_id
DB -> API: Updated
API -> App: Success
App -> User: Show device in garden

== Unassigning ESP from Garden ==
User -> App: Select "Unassign from Garden"
App -> API: POST /api/esp-devices/{esp_id}/unassign
API -> DB: Remove garden assignment
DB -> API: Updated
API -> App: Success
App -> User: Update device status

== Resetting ESP Device ==
User -> App: Select "Reset Device"
App -> User: Show confirmation
User -> App: Confirm reset
App -> API: POST /api/esp-devices/{esp_id}/reset
API -> DB: Clear assignments and credentials
DB -> API: Updated
API -> MQTT: Publish reset command to {mac}/reset
MQTT -> ESP: Forward reset command
ESP -> ESP: Reset to factory state
API -> App: Success
App -> User: Update device status

@enduml
